{"id":"629572","name":"酥脆盘丝饼","author":"阳台上的草莓","authorId":"7597089","desc":"","cover":"images/629572/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"300g"}],"sub":[{"name":"水","amount":"150g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面粉加水和成软面团醒10分钟。","img":"images/629572/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"面团揉光滑，分成小剂子擀开。","img":"images/629572/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"撒一层薄盐，刷一层油。","img":"images/629572/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"撒上五香粉，干面粉，把面片切条。","img":"images/629572/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"在刷一次油后卷成长条，再把长条卷紧。","img":"images/629572/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"按扁。","img":"images/629572/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"擀开成大饼胚，放入电饼铛盖上盖子上下火煎。","img":"images/629572/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"电饼铛指示灯灭后翻面。","img":"images/629572/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"烙两面金黄酥脆即可，切块装盘。","img":"images/629572/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/629572/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饼铛\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}